"title": "vineyard",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "vineyard",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Wanpela <b>vinyad</b>o wain gaden em i wanpela gaden we ol manmeri i save groim ol greip. Ol greip em ol sof, jusi frut we i save gro long wanpela diwai we ol i kolim wanpela greipvain. Ol manmeri i save kaikai greip fres yet, o draim ol long san. Taim ol i draim ol pinis, ol i save kolim ol olsem <b>ol reisin</b> na ol i ken stap longpela taim. Na tu, ol manmeri i ken kisim jus bilong ol greip long mekim wanpela alkohol dring we ol i kolim <a href=\"#t243\">wain</a>. Ol greip em ol i save stap long planti hap long <a href=\"#t74\">Israel</a>, na <a href=\"#t243\">wain</a>-em planti taim ol i save miksim wantaim wara-na em i wanpela dring we ol i save dring planti taim.</p><p>Wanpela vinyad em planti taim em i gat wanpela wol raunim em na ol wail animal o stilman i no inap long kam insait long gaden. Ol manmeri i save mekim dispela wol long ol liklik ston o long ol bus we i gat nilnil. Insait long vinyad i gat wanpela liklik haus bilong ol wasman. Dispela liklik haus em i stap antap liklik long olgeta gaden na bai ol wasman i ken lukluk antap long gaden. Dispela em ol i save kolim olsem wanpela <a href=\"#t144\">wotstawa</a>.</p><p>Na tu, i gat wanpela <a href=\"#t146\">wainpres</a>. Wanpela wainpres em i wanpela fletpela hap ston we i gat liklik wol i kam antap long olgeta sait bilong dispela fletpela ston. Ol manmeri i save kapsaitim ol greip i go long dispela ston na ol i save krungutim wantaim lek bilong ol. Dispela em bai skwisim jus i kamaut long ol greip. Dispela jus bai ron i go insait long wanpela kontena we ol i save kolim wain vet. Wanpela narapela we bilong rausim jus em long rolim wanpela hevipela ston antap long ol greip.</p><p>Ol vinyad em i save stap long planti hap tru long Israel na yumi planti taim i painim ol insait long ol tok piksa. Insait long Olpela Testamen, God sampela taim i save komperim ol manmeri bilong Israel wantaim wanpela vinyad, o wantaim wanpela diwai wain. Jisas i bin tokim sampela <b>stori we i gat tok skul bilong ol</b>na insait long ol dispela stori em i yusim ol samting we i toktok long wanpela diwai wai, wanpela vainyad, o wain, long tok klia long <a href=\"#t82\">kingdom bilong God</a>.</p>",
