"title": "vision",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "vision",
"language": "tpi",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Sapos yu gat wanpela visen, yu wok long lukim samting we i kam long God we ol narapela manmeri i no inap long lukim, o yu wok long harim samting we i kam long God we ol narapela manmeri i no inap long harim. God sampela taim i save givim visen long ol manmeri long tokim ol long ol samting we i bai kamap long bihaintaim, o long tokim wanpela man long mekim wanpela samting. Na tu, God i ken soim ol manmeri long samting insait long wanpela <a href=\"#t202\">driman</a>, taim ol i wok long slip, tasol wanpela visen em i save kamap taim wanpela man i no slip.</p>",
